According to the provided context, specifically the part about VarRLF-Report:

The UE shall determine the content in the VarRLF-Report as follows: 
1 > clear the information included in VarRLF-Report, if any;
1 > set the plmn-IdentityList to include the list of EPLMNs stored by the UE (i.e. includes the RPLMN);

Therefore, the UE includes the list of EPLMNs (which includes the RPLMN) in the plmn-IdentityList field of the VarRLF-Report. The source of this list is the list of EPLMNs stored by the UE.

When modifying an existing sl-MeasId from the sl-MeasIdToAddModList, the UE takes the following actions regarding reporting:

1. The UE removes the measurement reporting entry for this sl-MeasId from the VarMeasReportListSL, if included.
2. The UE stops the periodical reporting timer and resets the associated information (e.g., sl-TimeToTrigger) for this sl-MeasId.

These actions are specified in the context for when an entry with the matching sl-MeasId exists in the sl-MeasIdList within the VarMeasConfigSL:

```
The UE shall: 
1 > for each sl-MeasId included in the received sl-MeasIdToAddModList:
  2 > if an entry with the matching sl-MeasId exists in the sl-MeasIdList within the VarMeasConfigSL:
    3 > replace the entry with the value received for this sl-MeasId;
    3 > add a new entry for this sl-MeasId within the VarMeasConfigSL;
  2 > remove the measurement reporting entry for this sl-MeasId from the VarMeasReportListSL, if included;
  2 > stop the periodical reporting timer and reset the associated information (e.g. sl-TimeToTrigger) for this sl- MeasId;
```

According to the provided context:

1. Upon receiving an RRCReject message, the UE shall:
   - stop timer T300, if running;
   - stop timer T319, if running;
   - stop timer T319a, if running;
   - stop timer T302, if running;
   - reset MAC and release the default MAC Cell Group configuration;

2. If waitTime is configured in the RRCReject:
   - start timer T302, with the timer value set to the waitTime;

So, the action that a UE must take upon receiving an RRCReject message that includes the waitTime IE is to:

**start timer T302 with the timer value set to the waitTime.**
